meta {
  name: Download ASH termly tracking
  type: http
  seq: 17
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/ash/download/ashtracking
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download ASH Termly Tracking (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `ash_termly_tracking` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts the records to CSV using json2csv, and returns the CSV as raw file bytes with Content-Type: text/csv and Content-Disposition: attachment. The response is not JSON; frontend clients should read it as a Blob and trigger a browser download.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv; charset=utf-8`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="ash_termly_tracking.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per termly tracking record with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `studentId` | UUID foreign key referencing the ASH student |
  | `academicSession` | Academic session (e.g. `"2025/26"`) |
  | `term` | Term name (e.g. `"TERM 1"`, `"TERM 2"`, `"TERM 3"`) |
  | `schoolName` | Name of school attended during this term |
  | `schoolNumeracyScore` | School-reported numeracy score |
  | `schoolLiteracyScore` | School-reported literacy score |
  | `schoolAverage` | School-reported average of numeracy + literacy |
  | `schoolPosition` | Student's position in class (e.g. `"7th"`) |
  | `pretestNumeracyScore` | ASH pre-test numeracy score |
  | `pretestLiteracyScore` | ASH pre-test literacy score |
  | `pretestAverage` | Average of pre-test numeracy + literacy |
  | `midtestNumeracyScore` | ASH mid-test numeracy score |
  | `midtestLiteracyScore` | ASH mid-test literacy score |
  | `midtestAverage` | Average of mid-test numeracy + literacy |
  | `posttestNumeracyScore` | ASH post-test numeracy score |
  | `posttestLiteracyScore` | ASH post-test literacy score |
  | `posttestAverage` | Average of post-test numeracy + literacy |
  | `termResultUrl` | Cloudinary URL for term result document |
  | `termResultPublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for term result |
  | `disciplineRating` | Discipline rating (1–5) |
  | `responsibilityRating` | Responsibility rating (1–5) |
  | `leadershipRating` | Leadership rating (1–5) |
  | `notableAchievements` | Notable achievements observed during the term |
  | `challengesObserved` | Challenges observed during the term |
  | `nextTermRecommendations` | Recommendations for the next term |
  | `mentorName` | Name of the student's mentor |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
